 reusable definitions, subtype introductions and shared attributes. Independent stock belongs in changes, not here.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/DefinitionChange"},"maxItems":100,"type":"array"},"event_corrections":{"default":[],"description":"Incremental occurred-event corrections; omitted fields preserve canon. Effects remain engine-derived.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingEventCorrection"},"type":"array"},"event_withdrawals":{"default":[],"description":"Remove support for a pinned occurred-event version; does not assert non-occurrence.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingEventWithdrawal"},"type":"array"},"events":{"default":[],"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingEvent"},"type":"array"},"exhaustive_sets":{"default":[],"description":"Explicit objective exhaustive object collections. Absence of a declaration stays open/unknown; private contract review required.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingExhaustiveSet"},"type":"array"},"fact_endings":{"default":[],"description":"End an authored fact interval at an explicit tick on its original calendar; preserve past support.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingFactEnding"},"type":"array"},"fact_withdrawals":{"default":[],"description":"Withdraw authored support without asserting its opposite; historical revisions remain intact.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingFactWithdrawal"},"type":"array"},"initializations":{"default":[],"description":"Apply selected approved initial values once at an explicitly occurred instance start.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingInitialization"},"type":"array"},"interpretation_corrections":{"default":[],"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingInterpretationCorrection"},"type":"array"},"item_power_corrections":{"default":[],"description":"Version-bound grant corrections/endings. Omitted fields retain authored values; targets cannot change. Private contract review required.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingItemPowerCorrection"},"type":"array"},"item_powers":{"default":[],"description":"Explicit possession-dependent abilities; private contract review required. Possession is the named single-valued object holder property on this item, never inferred from an ownership relation.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingItemPower"},"type":"array"},"knowledge_boundaries":{"default":[],"description":"Explicit absence of knowledge for one holder and claim in the selected context/world/period; protected author contract review required. Missing knowledge remains unknown.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingKnowledgeBoundary"},"type":"array"},"knowledge_policies":{"default":[],"description":"Explicit context knowledge modes or communication chronology; private contract review required.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingKnowledgePolicy"},"type":"array"},"message_corrections":{"default":[],"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingMessageCorrection"},"type":"array"},"messages":{"default":[],"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingMessage"},"type":"array"},"narrative_works":{"default":[],"description":"Explicit named narrative works; publish before declaring an edition.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingNarrativeWork"},"type":"array"},"policy_corrections":{"default":[],"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingPolicyCorrection"},"type":"array"},"properties":{"default":[],"description":"Explicit property declarations; never inferred single-value resources. Existing definitions cannot be silently changed.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingProperty"},"type":"array"},"property_corrections":{"default":[],"description":"Explicit multiplicity/persistence corrections to existing named properties; omitted fields retain authored settings. Private contract review required; types and units cannot change.","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/WritingPropertyCorrection"},"type":"array"},"questions":{"default":[],"description":"Material ambiguities identified in the writing. Any unresolved question holds the entire delta without creating a candidate.\nNeutral material questions only. Do not propose a guessed owner/identity as fact while asking who is intended.","